The '''''Phi''-class shuttle''' was a class of [[shuttle]] used by the [[Galactic Empire]], including the [[Scythe (Phi-class)|''Scythe'']], which was used by members of the [[Inquisitorius]]<ref name="Dawn" /> and named for the [[Sith]] whom they served.<ref name="Scythe DB">{{Databank|scythe|Scythe}}</ref>

